msgstr "商用電源周波数変動に伴うハム波のドリフト"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_peak_tracking.ipynb:10009
#: 9bb36370bc864a15890dea2dc8291cab
msgid "Violin-mode resonances shifting with temperature"
msgstr "バイオリンモード共振周波数の温度依存ドリフト"

